d) \[DownQuestion]Es B unitaria? En caso negativo, transformarla en base \
unitaria.\
\>", "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.981601762952612*^9, 3.9816017637482224`*^9}, {
   3.9816025843141193`*^9, 3.9816026322171917`*^9}, {3.982927733640337*^9, 
